oddsSnapshots.description:
Stored odds rows for the eventId, both team orderings. `null` when the count
could not be taken when the game was archived ("not counted", never a false 0);
a later recount fills it.

partial_reason.description:
Only when `status` is 'partial': 'upstream_limited' = the Circa figures were withheld;
'book_unavailable' = one book has no recent read (that book is missing from `books`);
'upstream_paused' = no board at all is available: no book could be read and no board
from the last 12 hours exists (`data` is empty).
